1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,684
Top three true crime cases
tied to stories of demons.

2
00:00:03,934 --> 00:00:05,629
Number three: Son of Sam.

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:08,072
After shooting six people
to death in New York,

4
00:00:08,122 --> 00:00:09,830
David Berkowitz
claimed the one giving

5
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,826
him orders was his
neighbor's black dog.

6
00:00:12,076 --> 00:00:14,826
He said a 6,000-year-old
demon had possessed the dog

7
00:00:14,876 --> 00:00:16,871
and used its voice
to order him to kill.

8
00:00:17,121 --> 00:00:18,947
Two years later,
in a prison interview,

9
00:00:18,997 --> 00:00:20,489
Berkowitz admitted
he had made up

10
00:00:20,489 --> 00:00:22,093
the demon to
excuse his crimes.

11
00:00:22,343 --> 00:00:24,286
It was not until
1987 that he turned

12
00:00:24,286 --> 00:00:26,113
to God to beg
for forgiveness.

13
00:00:26,363 --> 00:00:28,256
Number two: the
Amityville house.

14
00:00:28,506 --> 00:00:30,629
One evening in
November 1974,

15
00:00:30,679 --> 00:00:32,291
Ronald DeFeo Jr.
ran into a bar,

16
00:00:32,291 --> 00:00:34,152
saying his parents
had been shot.

17
00:00:34,402 --> 00:00:36,960
Only when friends followed
him home did they discover

18
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:38,666
that all four of
his younger siblings

19
00:00:38,666 --> 00:00:40,347
were also dead in
their bedrooms.

20
00:00:40,597 --> 00:00:41,228
The next day,

21
00:00:41,228 --> 00:00:44,134
Ronald confessed that he was
the one who had fired the gun.

22
00:00:44,384 --> 00:00:45,882
In court, he said
voices had urged

23
00:00:45,882 --> 00:00:47,366
him to kill his
whole family.

24
00:00:47,616 --> 00:00:50,228
A year later, the Lutz
family moved into that house.

25
00:00:50,478 --> 00:00:52,921
Mr. Lutz said that when a
priest came to bless it,

26
00:00:52,971 --> 00:00:55,001
the priest heard a
voice shout: "Get out!"

27
00:00:55,251 --> 00:00:57,633
The Lutz family lasted
only 28 days there.

28
00:00:57,883 --> 00:01:00,375
Number one: the case behind
the movie Emily Rose.

29
00:01:00,625 --> 00:01:02,783
Two years after
Anneliese Michel died,

30
00:01:02,833 --> 00:01:04,184
her sister heard
her voice again,

31
00:01:04,184 --> 00:01:05,576
in the middle
of a courtroom.

32
00:01:05,826 --> 00:01:08,705
The court was playing a tape
recorded during an exorcism.

33
00:01:08,955 --> 00:01:11,033
On the tape, two
priests recite prayers,

34
00:01:11,083 --> 00:01:12,707
while Anneliese
screams back in a

35
00:01:12,707 --> 00:01:14,722
voice almost impossible
to recognize.

36
00:01:14,972 --> 00:01:15,999
During those rituals,

37
00:01:15,999 --> 00:01:18,953
she sometimes called herself
Lucifer, and sometimes Judas.

38
00:01:19,203 --> 00:01:20,868
Anneliese died
at the age of 23

39
00:01:20,868 --> 00:01:22,889
from malnutrition
and dehydration.

40
00:01:23,139 --> 00:01:25,552
By then, she weighed
only about 68 pounds.

41
00:01:25,802 --> 00:01:28,577
Her parents and the two priests
sat at the defendants' table.

42
00:01:28,827 --> 00:01:31,509
All four were later convicted
of negligent homicide.

